创建数据表
```
  curl -X POST 'http://{host}:{port}/api/v3/horizon/v1/table/create' \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -H 'api-key: api_key' \
    -H 'sensorsdata-project: default' \
    -d '{
    "project_id": 1,
    "table": {
      "db_name": "test_db",
      "name": "test_table",
      "type": "TABLE",
      "engine": "MUTABLE",
      "primary_keys": ["id"],
      "columns": [
        {
          "name": "id",
          "dw_data_type": "STRING"
        }
      ]
    }
  }'
